# Stables Mandatory Handshake

At the start of **every session**, before any work, read these two files in order:

1. `0_handshake/README.md` — orientation and calibration order
2. `0_handshake/session_map.md` — full file map and task→file matrix

Then follow the calibration steps in `0_handshake/handshake.md`.

**MiniDapp / `.mds.zip` work:** read `0_handshake/minidapp_version.md` first so you edit the **active** `prod_stables_app_*` folder (currently **v0.2.11**).

Confirm calibration by stating:
> "Calibration Active: Working on the basis of the Unified Handshake."

**Never start work without this confirmation.**

