## UI QUICK RULES (no file read needed — these are always active)

Any time you touch HTML or CSS, these rules apply before you write a single line.

### Design Tokens (from live site `https://stablescouncil.github.io/`, fetched 2026-03-11)

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `--bg` | `#0b0f14` |
| `--panel` | `#101826` |
| `--text-primary` | `#e6edf3` |
| `--text-secondary` / `--muted` | `#9fb0c0` |
| `--accent-cyan` / `--accent` | `#67e8f9` |
| `--accent-purple` | `#a78bfa` |
| `--glow` | `rgba(103,232,249,0.15)` |

### Buttons — exact classes from `stables.css`

```html
<!-- Primary: cyan-to-purple gradient, light text -->
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="URL">Label</a>

<!-- Secondary: dark semi-transparent, cyan border, light text -->
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="URL">Label</a>

<!-- Group wrapper -->
<div class="buttons">
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Primary</a>
  <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Secondary</a>
</div>
```

- Shape: `border-radius: 16px` (rounded rectangle — NOT full pills)
- Size: `width: 220px`, `height: 64px`
- All buttons have: `border: 1px solid rgba(103,232,249,0.3)` + cyan glow shadow
- `btn-primary` background: `linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(103,232,249,0.3), rgba(167,139,250,0.3))`
- `btn-secondary` background: `rgba(15,23,42,0.6)`
- **`btn-link` does not exist. Never use it.**

### Never

- Hardcode a colour that has a token above.
- Define `.btn`, `.badge`, `.buttons`, or `.container` locally.
- Use any font other than Inter (imported by `stables.css`).
- Build UI without linking `stables.css` first.

